  "goodToKnow": "Die Polemik is polemic, a sharp, aggressive attack in words, or polemical style: Das ist doch nur Polemik! Polemisch means polemical: eine polemische Bemerkung. It's often contrasted with sachlich (objective, factual), a key German virtue in debate: Bleiben wir sachlich. Lessing and Karl Kraus were famous German-language polemicists. From Greek polemos (war). Plural: die Polemiken."
